{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ec0fa43ff55518cfd5a5eba27eec73b6b255f3c71552a4da7230e9d4f6f46e4", "ja": "（今日は、環の宣材写真撮影だ。\n環にとって、初仕事になるわけだけど……）", "zh": "（今天环要来拍宣传照。\n对环来说，这是她的第一份工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "3c1a844cfff5819dd2f1267003f25125e22e1c4a40beb1d816f6e1fcd7dfb3ce", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！\nたまき、『めいく』してもらったよ！　どう？", "zh": "老大～！\n有人帮环『化妆』了耶！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "63d3cd148624b670d8aa24327b3ca7a26c774f6b588c7699e7deb3c906f867c7", "ja": "そうか、どれどれ……\nうん、バッチリだな。可愛いぞ！", "zh": "这样啊，我看看……\n嗯，化得很好，很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "8196e6714ee1ae63cbf784df6b88d3416c6a72831df726c51c040dd63c519412", "ja": "ほんと？\nたまき、変じゃない？", "zh": "真的吗？\n环看起来不会很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d9373363916f704f546292c50cfe86c9363f627352a5a1c9f7b96c79f7cb06b", "ja": "たまきも、鏡見たけど……\nなんかいつもと違って、そわそわする……。", "zh": "环自己刚刚照了镜子……\n感觉跟平常不太一样，真不自在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f350022f69040f8c3f89dd11a9dbaba9820523463184dc938ad2a853b39241da", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。\nそれじゃ、スタジオに行こうか。", "zh": "不用这么担心，没问题的。\n好啦，我们去摄影棚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "9bdc42f85e8755d01973a5fd88c7f107c140c2aced7a0c379758ffa7cf608974", "ja": "わ～！？\nなんか、見たことない機械がいっぱいある～！", "zh": "哇～！？\n有好多没看过的机器喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e3e395bb0f49e7fd0c69347e07c9cb66f468d0d61da63f5d105b90882c869730", "ja": "こ、こら、環！\nスタジオの中を走っちゃダメだって……。", "zh": "喂、喂！环！\n摄影棚里不要用跑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "0bece181237c6718ad2537d7d56172b66ad139d042459f7d32803c0debd7cb58", "ja": "ねえねえおやぶん、これなに！？\nなんの機械！？", "zh": "欸欸，老大，这是什么！？\n这是什么机器！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6781029d4744854b76766a9b7fadfd3e0ce76370968e1fc5c226543dbf3d8187", "ja": "え？\nうーん、なんだろうな……。", "zh": "呃？\n嗯──我也不知道耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1011_camman", "source_sha256": "313701bef73e6b17eaa4a7769ee410ddf65b376d9102add777a6457f453f9289", "ja": "それも、カメラなんですよ。\nちょっと珍しいかもしれないですけど。", "zh": "那个也是相机喔。\n只是可能有点少见吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "7138ef7b393d297075b93feda0770e6e89bf84c5eccf883944146d01eb4fef64", "ja": "カメラなの！？\nたまき、こんなカメラ初めて見た！", "zh": "这是相机！？\n环第一次看到这种相机耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1013_camman", "source_sha256": "ab6cb81aab172111ee9f18676e0055dabf07ed2f607844a64c1d8dae4703c566", "ja": "あなたが、環ちゃんね。\n私が今日のカメラマンです、よろしくね。", "zh": "你就是小环吧？\n我是负责今天拍摄的摄影师，请多指教喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "c55fbf74e584e155ef0d526961605242bc241cfb2ca662c9aa2e80f34b632c8a", "ja": "大神環です！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我叫大神环！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "c392361218ebea7c678486710cad07759ec22869264d3cbe95d99b4d4f71024a", "ja": "ねえねえおやぶん、ここ、面白いものが\nいーっぱいあるね！　くふふ…♪", "zh": "欸欸，老大，\n这里有好～多有趣的东西喔！呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f9eccd54950b81a7dbfe6c610f37ab0d1acac0b6585e64add53ff99f1ad95e4d", "ja": "見るだけだからな、触っちゃダメだぞ。\nすみません、騒がしくて……。", "zh": "只能用看的，不可以乱碰喔。\n不好意思，这孩子太吵了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1017_camman", "source_sha256": "b0487240eefb492dcc4bca882cacde09da6b6c7042c0b331def09b087cd53b83", "ja": "いいえ！\nとっても元気で、いいと思いますよ。", "zh": "不会的！\n她这么有精神，我觉得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1018_camman", "source_sha256": "e6e1074e11123c4a96b5ca2f6ea01d7c8000b4d69bf3612b9acf07291dfbb7e2", "ja": "それに、いい笑顔ですしね。\n環ちゃん、このまま撮影しちゃいましょう！", "zh": "而且笑容也很灿烂。\n小环，我们直接开始拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "290feee14b9abf39314805ee0a6bf5f801170b44d7a600794b8ecf5ea4f1a2db", "ja": "はーいっ♪", "zh": "好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "41c097097b917f69b8ff5fb41075f9c2f5c1b7aad128e0e1d91940b9ab55b126", "ja": "（カメラマンさんがうまく乗せてくれたおかげで、\n撮影は無事終了。写真も、いい感じだ！）", "zh": "（摄影师巧妙地带领着环，\n顺利完成拍摄。照片也拍得很棒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "9428673ff206c15a7e1d135649b22e1a4c79be558fbaff8f5c53ab0242aa8470", "ja": "これが、たまき？\nやっぱり、たまきじゃないみたい……。", "zh": "这是环吗？\n感觉环真的变成另一个人了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "aba01586f3619d01e4e0ed381dbd4188156e2d75d7775de8f77977e68d19051f", "ja": "おやぶん、これ本当にたまきなの？　鏡で見たり、\nじいちゃんに撮ってもらった写真と、全然違う……。", "zh": "老大，这真的是环吗？\n跟平常照镜子或是爷爷拍的照片都完全不一样耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ee27a44a6e497809073a1cc96f624e0ba3e652906c4fcf9c8d578ba73b7fbd3c", "ja": "もちろん、本物の環だよ。\n気に入らないか？", "zh": "不用怀疑，这真的就是环。\n你不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "74f649d9f3880f5f71242e96dba271e2497d75d044981559de2ce9dc18451da7", "ja": "ん～～。たまき、よくわかんない……。\nおやぶんは、どう思う？", "zh": "嗯～～环自己也不太清楚……\n老大，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c14f9d2a31f332afbcadadf2c1d4522543ada89236f8e5f4e056711a32beef85", "ja": "俺は、いいと思うよ。\nこの写真は、これからの新しい環だし。", "zh": "我觉得很棒哦。\n这张照片上的，就是将来全新的环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "cd0f78822d99b0ccb112a4216cac2fe6db88c3837afecd7299ad37519db79c07", "ja": "これからの……新しい、たまき？", "zh": "将来……全新的、环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0d3b87df21a70a5264cf8991dd64213c421165beb10d5f054d4adeb189bc37a2", "ja": "そう、アイドルとしての環、って言えばいいのかな？", "zh": "没错，应该说是成为偶像的环，这样比较对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "76de41e38a6e6fa00af3bf692d8f3bcfd24dafac0bdd33a551f88adcc8c8416a", "ja": "外で遊んだり、学校で勉強してる時とは違う環だ。\nいい写真だと思うよ。", "zh": "不同于在外面玩或是去上学读书的环。\n我觉得这照片拍得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "5924b657e62a46b177ffc67bf8f11c22edd9e31a65010819550fcb11eb775f85", "ja": "アイドルとしてのたまきは、\n学校にいる時と違うたまき……。", "zh": "当偶像的环\n跟去上学的环不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "17399d6f488d4e35aa5a7a9d403207816dd1093327a8a4a827d042167bce369e", "ja": "……うん！　わかった！　たまき、ちょっと\n照れちゃうけど……このたまきも、好きだぞ！", "zh": "……嗯！环懂了！\n虽然有点不好意思……不过环也很喜欢这样的自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "90411b6e3cf64bf411879808738c687bc276ed80a517dfd422ba1b87a616563f", "ja": "ねえ、おやぶん。\nまたこういう写真、とってもらえる？", "zh": "问你喔，老大，\n环可以再来拍这种照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5b788c573383c415388678194fe4c2ff158f3393910b8bc83734f1823607eb30", "ja": "もちろん。この写真が、環の最初のお仕事だ。\nこれからいっぱい、アイドルのお仕事しような！", "zh": "当然可以。这照片就是环的第一份工作，\n以后还要做很多偶像的工作喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "ffde8dd35ed1de6ce5dd93b36b8962d81db7d2421a8709f4c3f5c3a918e208d6", "ja": "うんっ！\nおやぶん、ありがとっ！", "zh": "好！\n老大，谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9661e3c7411653574ca1b81f9f1bf8319530312197d66e9a2828f1ff12b78866", "ja": "（初めての撮影なのに、笑顔が絶えなかった。\n環は案外、本番に強いのかもな……）", "zh": "（虽然是第一次摄影，但是她脸上一直保持笑容。\n环说不定在关键时刻很能发挥……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_002_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c1ce5ca1ea4c68dcc32e42ddb316178e938281ee3f06f6f075c386598a2c1cb3", "ja": "（これから環は、アイドルとして、\n様々な顔を見せてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（以后环身为一个偶像，\n想必还会展现出各种样貌吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
